# removal-lab --script for z6-bridge.jpg (4024 × 6048 after EXIF rotation): hover the boy,
# sweep the pointer at 120 Hz across him and across the bridge, click to remove him, undo, then
# brush over him and save. Coordinates are source pixels.
settle
hover 1690,3550
settle
path 1500,3000 1900,4200 60 8
settle
path 400,2600 3600,5200 120 8
settle
click 1690,3550
expect removals 1
undo
brush 80
stroke 1650,3000 1700,3500 1720,4000
expect decision one
expect removals 2
save
